he fourth turn, from the east by the eighth. It will shoot at anything that is not Directorate. Take down the Goliath before the two of them take us down.","goal":"Destroy the Goliath fortress in the Ashfall yards within 26 turns.","guards":2,"chapter":"Act II · The Fork · Mission 7","strategy":["Cross the burning approach between the plasma clouds; clear the Pandora mines and Remora decoys with ranged fire.","Send a fast group along the comet tail in the north to take the grey dock on the north mooring.","Break in through the west gate; mecha can climb the bedrock to the south gate. Kill the turrets on the railway loop first.","Empty or destroy the two cartel docks before their cargo floods the decks.","The Directorate task force arrives from the north on turn 4 and the east on turn 8. Keep the Goliath under fire whatever happens."],"plan":[{"n":1,"path":[[5,10],[18,10],[30,10]]},{"n":2,"path":[[4,6],[14,3],[40,2]]},{"n":3,"path":[[30,10],[33,10],[40,10]]},{"n":5,"at":[44,1],"note":"Directorate T4"},{"n":5,"at":[56,10],"note":"T8"}],"comms":[{"speaker":"sato","text":"For Arkin. Then we grieve. Not before."},{"speaker":"moraine","text":"You killed my fleet for a principle, General. Let's see if your principle holds a wall."},{"speaker":"ruess","text":"The railway loop runs round the fortress. Two Dragons and a Hydra ride it. The gates are narrow: go through them fast."},{"speaker":"kessrin","text":"Two problems, one stone. My task force has orders to sink whatever is still moving when it arrives."},{"speaker":"sato","text":"There is an empty grey dock on the north mooring. Somebody should take it before Kessrin does."}]}